RESULTS:1 =　　　「자신의 HP를 완전 회복하고, 추가로 즉사 공격을 1회 방어하는 결계를 부여한다.」

@SKILL_ACTIONABLE_BATTLE_AW_760, ARG
RETURN 0

;継承に必要な部位
@SKILL_SKILLEND_AW_760,ARG
#DIM LCOUNT
;場にでて健在じゃないとだめ
SIF !IS_TARGET_ABLE(ARG)
	RETURN 0
;入力可能な状態じゃないとだめ
SIF !ACTIONABLE_CHARA_F(ARG)
	RETURN 0
;味方の誰かが死んでいる必要がある。
FOR LCOUNT, 0, BCHARANUM
	SIF !IS_FRIEND(BCHARA:LCOUNT)
		CONTINUE
	SIF !GET_CREC_ACT(, BCHARA:LCOUNT, "KILL")
		CONTINUE
	CALL ACTION_AW_760, ARG, , [[스킬:각성스킬]]
	BREAK
NEXT

;====================================================
;スキル及び行動の実行
;====================================================
@ACTION_AW_760,ARG,ARG:1, ARG:2
#DIM LCOUNT
IF CFLAG:ARG:PT플래그 > 0
	SETCOLOR COLOR("FRIEND")
ELSE
	SETCOLOR COLOR("ENEMY")
ENDIF

CALL PRINT_ACT_MESSAGE, ARG,  SKILL_NUM_F("각성스킬"), , , , "NOWAIT"
RESETCOLOR
CALL SKILL_INVALID_WALL, ARG, ARG, "테트라쟈", "短縮"
CALL HEAL_SINGLE, ARG, ARG, ARG:2, , , TSTR:스킬메시지추가효과
